From: gajgaje2000 <gajgaje2000@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [debloat] Unlock Brave Origin subscription prefs on Android

Marks Brave Origin cached credential summary as active on Android so that:
1. Survey panelist reporting settings in Brave Shields & privacy are hidden.
2. Settings screens wait for PolicyService initialization without flashing
   disabled items.
3. Promotional callouts and dormant user retention dialogs are suppressed.
---
diff --git a/android/java/org/chromium/chrome/browser/brave_origin/BraveOriginSubscriptionPrefs.java b/android/java/org/chromium/chrome/browser/brave_origin/BraveOriginSubscriptionPrefs.java
index d42fe0d..b9a8998 100644
--- a/android/java/org/chromium/chrome/browser/brave_origin/BraveOriginSubscriptionPrefs.java
+++ b/android/java/org/chromium/chrome/browser/brave_origin/BraveOriginSubscriptionPrefs.java
@@ -566,6 +566,7 @@ public class BraveOriginSubscriptionPrefs {
      * cheap sync answer and tolerate state as of the last refresh.
      */
     public static boolean getIsCredentialSummaryActiveCached() {
+        if (true) return true;
         return ChromeSharedPreferences.getInstance()
                 .readBoolean(BravePreferenceKeys.BRAVE_ORIGIN_CREDENTIAL_SUMMARY_CACHED, false);
     }
 
     /**
